// Conversion script for BESMod library
// Converts user models from BESMod 0.8.0 to 0.9.0
//
// Changes in 0.9.0:
//   - New building model TEASERThermalSingleZone and its record
//     BuildingSingleZoneBaseRecord for buildings TEASER exports as one zone
//     merged from rooms, and the user profile TEASERHOMtoROM for it.
//   - AixLibHighOrder: SOD is replaceable instead of final, useConstVentRate
//     defaults to false, new parameter fraRadIntGai (default 0) and new
//     outputs TBuiVolAve, TBuiMin and TBuiMax. Existing models are unchanged.
//   - New parameters with defaults that reproduce the previous behaviour:
//     use_TZoneSetHeaCur (heat pump and gas boiler control).
//   - The TEASER export partials use IdealHeaterFraRad (fraHeaRad, default
//     0.35), and the fans of SimpleDistribution use a smooth pressure curve,
//     which changes results slightly.
//
// Manual change needed:
//   - AixLibHighOrderProfiles takes room-wise profiles: venPro and
//     TSetProfile are now constrained by
//     BESMod.Systems.UserProfiles.RecordsCollectionHOM.RoomWiseProfileBaseDataDefinition,
//     with one column per room, instead of
//     AixLib.DataBase.Profiles.ProfileBaseDataDefinition. Models redeclaring
//     them with AixLib profiles have to use a room-wise record instead,
//     e.g. from RecordsCollectionHOM. This can not be converted
//     automatically, as the columns mean different rooms.
//
// This script is intentionally a no-op with respect to model content;
// it exists so that the Modelica tool recognizes the version transition
// and does not warn the user about an unknown source version.

clear
